#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"
msgstr "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "`.content` — Hovedindholdsruden, der udfylder det resterende område ved siden af bakken."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."
msgstr "Når moderelementets inline-size falder under `46em` (`16em` bakkebredde + `30em` breakpoint), sænker en `@container` forespørgsel på moderelementets `pantoken-drawer-layout` beholder automatisk dette members `min-inline-size` til `0`, hvilket matcher den manuelle `[should-overlay-tray]` tilsidesættelse."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Bær `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout-konvention) og navngiv det med `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby`, når kontekst alene ikke identificerer det."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.tray](/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.tray](/da/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — Det tilstødende panel i samme flex-række."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-drawer-layout` — A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "`.instui-drawer-layout` — Et delt layout med en sammenklappelig sidetray og et primært scrollbar indholdspanel."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr "`-placement-end` og standarden (start) bruger begge `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logiske egenskaber, ikke `left`/`right`, så trayens side følger automatisk `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` — der er ikke behov for separate RTL-regler."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When the tray acts as navigation, label it with an accessible heading or `aria-label`. Give `.content` `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Når trayen fungerer som navigation, mærk den med en tilgængelig overskrift eller `aria-label`. Giv `.content` `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout-konvention) og navngiv den med `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby`, når konteksten alene ikke identificerer den."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the tray even when the `open` attribute is absent."
msgstr "Vis trayen selv når `open`-attributten mangler."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-end side."
msgstr "Dok trayen på inline-end-siden."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-start side (the default; sets it explicitly)."
msgstr "Dok trayen på inline-start-siden (standard; angiver det eksplicit)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Render the tray as an overlay instead of shrinking content inline."
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The main pane."
msgstr "Hovedpanelet."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel."
msgstr "Sidepanelet."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Width threshold for overlay mode (`30em`, themed via responsive utilities)."
msgstr "Breddegrænse for overlay-tilstand (`30em`, tematiseret via responsive værktøjer)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` members switch to overlay mode automatically via a `@container` query once this element's inline-size drops below tray-width + `--pantoken-bp-md`. The `@pantoken/interactions` behavior additionally toggles `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (a manual override) and emits `overlaytraychange` for apps that need the change as an event."
msgstr "- Medlemmerne `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` skifter automatisk til overlay-tilstand via en `@container`-forespørgsel, når dette elements inline-size falder under tray-bredden + `--pantoken-bp-md`. `@pantoken/interactions`-adfærden skifter desuden `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (en manuel overskrivelse) og udsender `overlaytraychange` for apps, der har brug for ændringen som en hændelse."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A standalone edge overlay; this layout keeps tray and content in the same flow.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A smaller anchored surface for contextual actions and detail."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — Et selvstændigt kant-overlay; dette layout holder tray og indhold i samme flow.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — En mindre forankret flade til kontekstuelle handlinger og detaljer."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tray` — The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "`.tray` — Sidepanelet ved siden af hovedindholdet, med valgfrie overlay- og bakke-lignende overflademodifikatorer."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positioning uses `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (never `left`/`right`), so `-placement-end` docks to the true trailing edge in both LTR and RTL."
msgstr "Positionering bruger `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (aldrig `left`/`right`), så `-placement-end` fastgøres til den faktiske bageste kant i både LTR og RTL."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "If used as navigation, wrap links in a semantic `<nav>` and provide an accessible name."
msgstr "Hvis den bruges som navigation, indpak links i et semantisk `<nav>` og giv det et tilgængeligt navn."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock this tray to inline-end when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Fastgør denne bakke til inline-end, når overlay-tilstand er aktiv."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the panel edge border."
msgstr "Fjern panelkantens ramme."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove elevation when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Fjern elevation, når overlay-tilstand er aktiv."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — The primary pane that flexes alongside this member."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — Det primære panel, der tilpasser sig fleksibelt ved siden af dette element."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: file-drop"
msgstr ""

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-file-drop` — A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "`.instui-file-drop` — Et fil-dropområde med svæv-, accepteret- og afvist-tilstande."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` classes are purely visual — actual drag-and-drop detection and file validation are the consumer's JS to wire up around the wrapped native input."
msgstr "The `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` classes are purely visual — den faktiske drag-and-drop-detektion og filvalidering er forbrugerens JS, som skal kobles på omkring den indpakkede native input."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap a native `<input type=\"file\">` in the `<label>` drop zone so it stays a real, labelled file control that the keyboard and assistive tech can operate."
msgstr "Pak et native `<input type=\"file\">` ind i `<label>` dropzonen, så det forbliver en reel, mærket filkontrol, som tastaturet og hjælpemidler kan betjene."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for an acceptable file."
msgstr "Træk-tilstand for en accepteret fil."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hover or drag-over state."
msgstr "Svæv- eller træk-over-tilstand."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the leading dropzone glyph icon."
msgstr "Gengiv det førende dropzone-glyfikon."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for a rejected file."
msgstr "Træk-tilstand for en afvist fil."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-group` — A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-group` — En `<fieldset>` gruppe med en legend, et kolonne- eller inline-layout og konfigurerbar afstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between fields, tunable with the `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` modifiers below — prefer those over chaining a generic `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier, which overrides the built-in value outright."
msgstr "Sætter sin egen `gap` mellem felter, justerbar med `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*`-modifikatorerne nedenfor — foretræk disse frem for at kæde en generisk `-gap-*` spacing-utility-modifikator, som tilsidesætter den indbyggede værdi fuldstændigt."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`, so the legend text names the whole group for assistive tech."
msgstr "Renderer et native `<fieldset>` med en `<legend>`, så legendeteksten navngiver hele gruppen for hjælpeteknologi."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large column gap."
msgstr "Stor kolonneafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium column gap."
msgstr "Mellem kolonneafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No column gap."
msgstr "Ingen kolonneafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small column gap."
msgstr "Lille kolonneafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align child fields to a shared grid."
msgstr "Justér børnefelterne til et delt grid."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields out in columns."
msgstr "Arranger børnefelterne i kolonner."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields inline, in a row."
msgstr "Arranger børnefelterne inline i en række."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the group as required."
msgstr "Marker gruppen som påkrævet."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large row gap."
msgstr "Stor rækkeafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium row gap."
msgstr "Mellem rækkeafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No row gap."
msgstr "Ingen rækkeafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small row gap."
msgstr "Lille rækkeafstand."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the fields."
msgstr "Bundjustér felterne."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Middle-align the fields."
msgstr "Midterjustér felterne."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the fields."
msgstr "Topjustér felterne."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the legend text when the group is required."
msgstr "Renderer det dekorative stjerne-tegn for påkrævede felter efter legendeteksten, når gruppen er påkrævet."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `-layout-aligned` mode uses CSS subgrid behind an `@supports` guard; where subgrid is unsupported, the fields fall back to their own stacked layout."
msgstr "- `-layout-aligned`-tilstanden bruger CSS subgrid bag en `@supports`-vagt; hvor subgrid ikke understøttes, falder felterne tilbage til deres eget stablede layout."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — The single field this group repeats.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Groups radio inputs under a legend."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Det enkelte felt som denne gruppe gentager.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Grupperer radio-inputs under en legend."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-messages"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Felthjælp og valideringsmeddelelser — hint, fejl, succes og kun til skærmlæsere — med et ikon ved fejl og succes."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between stacked messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Sætter sin egen `gap` mellem stablede meddelelser; kædning af en `-gap-*` spacing-utility-modifikator overskriver den indbyggede værdi."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `-type-screenreader-only` message is visually hidden but stays in the accessibility tree, so it's still announced; pair error and success messages with the field via aria-describedby so assistive tech reads them with the control."
msgstr "En `-type-screenreader-only`-meddelelse er visuelt skjult, men forbliver i tilgængelighedstræet, så den stadig annonceres; par fejl- og succesmeddelelser med feltet via aria-describedby, så hjælpemidler læser dem sammen med kontrollen."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-type-error`."
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An individual message; its `-type-*` picks the hint, error, success, or screen-reader-only variant."
msgstr "En individuel meddelelse; dens `-type-*` vælger hint-, fejl-, succes- eller kun-til-skærmlæsere-varianten."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the leading status glyph on error and success messages: an alert circle for errors and a check circle for success."
msgstr "Viser det førende statusikon på fejl- og succesmeddelelser: en advarselscirkel for fejl og en cirkel med flueben for succes."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Wraps a label, controls, and these messages."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Indpakker en label, kontroller og disse meddelelser."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field` — En wrapper til et formularfelt: et label, dets controls og inline-, required- eller readonly-layouts."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` (after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "En fejlmeddelelse forbliver skjult, indtil feltets control er `:user-invalid` (efter brugerinteraktion) eller du tilføjer klassen `-invalid`. Brug `-layout-inline` for at placere label ved siden af controls og `-layout-stacked` for at placere det ovenover. Sætter også sit eget `gap` mellem label, controls og meddelelser; kædning af en `-gap-*` spacing-utility-modifier overskriver den indbyggede værdi."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `<label>` element wraps the control, so the label text names it natively; the required asterisk is decorative and should be hidden from assistive tech (aria-hidden), and the error message surfaces once the control is `:user-invalid` or you add the `-invalid` class."
msgstr "`<label>`-elementet omslutter controlen, så label-teksten navngiver den nativt; det påkrævede asterisk er dekorativ og bør være skjult for assistiv teknologi (aria-hidden), og fejlmeddelelsen vises, når controlen er `:user-invalid` eller du tilføjer klassen `-invalid`."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout (shorthand for `-layout-inline`)."
msgstr "Inline-layout (kortform for `-layout-inline`)."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the label text."
msgstr "Justér label-teksten mod enden."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the label text."
msgstr "Justér label-teksten mod starten."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout: label beside the controls."
msgstr "Inline-layout: label ved siden af controls."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stacked layout: label above the controls."
msgstr "Stablet layout: label over controls."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Bundjuster labelen med controls."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Topjuster labelen med controls."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control area beside or below the label."
msgstr "Kontrolområdet ved siden af eller under labelen."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The field label."
msgstr "Feltets label."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the label text when the field is required."
msgstr "Renderer det dekorative påkrævede-asterisk efter label-teksten, når feltet er påkrævet."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renders the field's hint, error, and success messages.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Groups related fields under a shared legend."
msgstr "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renderer feltets hint-, fejl- og succesmeddelelser.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Grupperer relaterede felter under en fælles legend."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: gap"
msgstr ""

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap`-utilities på afstandsskalaen, kort (`--gap-sm`) eller lang (`--gap-small`) stavemåde. Kan bruges alene eller kædes på ethvert komponent (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — komponenter, der allerede sætter deres egen `gap` fra et komponent-specifikt token, kan få den overskrevet."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the medium spacing token as the gap."
msgstr "Anvender det mellemste afstands-token som gap."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Gap utilities across short and long spacing-step spellings."
msgstr "Gap-utilities på tværs af korte og lange stavemåder for afstandstrin."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: heading"
msgstr ""

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-heading` — Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "`.instui-heading` — Overskriftstypografi fra `-level-h1` til `-level-h6`."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets override a `-level-*`'s font-size and font-weight, so combine only one of each family per element."
msgstr "Forudindstillingerne `-variant-*` overskriver en `-level-*`'s font-size og font-weight, så kombiner kun én fra hver familie pr. element."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These classes set the visual level only, so render a real `<h1>`–`<h6>` (or use `role=\"heading\"` with `aria-level`) to convey the heading level."
msgstr "Disse klasser angiver kun det visuelle niveau, så gengiv et ægte `<h1>`–`<h6>` (eller brug `role=\"heading\"` med `aria-level`) for at formidle overskriftsniveauet."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a bottom rule."
msgstr "Tilføj en bundlinje."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a top rule."
msgstr "Tilføj en toplinje."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AI-accent colour."
msgstr "AI-accentfarve."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Primary colour."
msgstr "(standard) Primærfarve."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) colour."
msgstr "På mørk (primær invers) farve."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary (muted) colour."
msgstr "Sekundær (dæmpet) farve."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h1 type scale."
msgstr "Gengiv i h1-typografisk skala."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h2 type scale."
msgstr "Gengiv i h2-typografisk skala."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h3 type scale."
msgstr "Gengiv i h3-typografisk skala."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h4 type scale."
msgstr "Gengiv i h4-typografisk skala."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h5 type scale."
msgstr "Gengiv i h5-typografisk skala."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h6 type scale."
msgstr "Gengiv i h6-typografisk skala."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label type preset."
msgstr "Forudindstilling for label-typografi."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mini card-title preset."
msgstr "Forudindstilling for mini korttitel."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Regular card-title preset."
msgstr "Forudindstilling for almindelig korttitel."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Card section-title preset."
msgstr "Forudindstilling for kort-sektionstitel."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page-title preset."
msgstr "Forudindstilling for sidetitel."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Section-title preset."
msgstr "Forudindstilling for sektionstitel."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography for non-heading text."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Brødteksttypografi til tekst, der ikke er overskrifter."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: hero"
msgstr ""

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Header-sektion i fuld bredde med titel, undertitel og valgfrit baggrundsbillede."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Hero when:"
msgstr "✅ Brug Hero når:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
msgstr "- Du har brug for en fremtrædende sideoverskrift med visuel hierarki\n- Siden har fordel af en stor, iøjnefaldende åbningssektion\n- Du vil inkludere baggrundsbilleder eller gradient-accenter\n🚫 Brug ikke Hero når:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"
msgstr "- Bygger du en simpel sideoverskrift — brug i stedet Page-Layout\n- Hero'en konkurrerer med kritisk indhold — prioriter læsbarhed"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the title is in an `<h1>` tag for semantic structure\n- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"
msgstr "- Sørg for, at titlen er i en `<h1>` tag for semantisk struktur\n- Hvis du bruger baggrundsbilleder, sørg for tilstrækkelig farvekontrast for tekst\n- Undgå automatisk afspilning af video eller animation, der kan distrahere fra indholdet"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero subtitle content"
msgstr "Hero undertitelindhold"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero title content"
msgstr "Hero titelindhold"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional action buttons or links."
msgstr "Valgfri handlingsknapper eller links."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional background layer (image or gradient)."
msgstr "Valgfrit baggrundslag (billede eller gradient)."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for hero text and actions."
msgstr "Container til hero-tekst og handlinger."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional semi-transparent overlay for text contrast."
msgstr "Valgfri semitransparent overlay for tekstkontrast."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional supporting text or description."
msgstr "Valgfri understøttende tekst eller beskrivelse."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main hero title (typically `<h1>`)."
msgstr "Hoved-hero-titel (typisk `<h1>`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: icon"
msgstr ""

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-icon` — The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "`.instui-icon` — Ikonsystemet: `.instui-icon`-størrelser plus den delte `-icon-<name>`-maler, der masker en glyf (i `currentColor`) før ethvert element."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph is decorative, so mark it `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; give it a `role` or label only when the icon conveys meaning on its own."
msgstr "Glyfen er dekorativ, så marker den som `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; giv den en `role` eller en etiket kun, når ikonet i sig selv formidler betydning."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set the glyph token (`--pantoken-glyph`) and render it via the shared painter (for example `-icon-search`)."
msgstr "Angiv glyf-tokenet (`--pantoken-glyph`) og rendér det via den delte maler (for eksempel `-icon-search`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph itself: a 1em box masked from `--pantoken-glyph` and filled with `currentColor`."
msgstr "Selve glyfen: en 1em-boks maskeret fra `--pantoken-glyph` og udfyldt med `currentColor`."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: img"
msgstr ""

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-img` — A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "`.instui-img` — En styllet `<img>` med visnings-, beskærings- og effekt-modifikatorer, der kan stables."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Effects compose through the shared `--pantoken-img-filter` custom property, so `-with-grayscale` and `-with-blur` can apply together; the `-constrain-*` crop modifiers require the consumer to size the box explicitly."
msgstr "Effekter komponeres via den delte `--pantoken-img-filter`-egenskab, så `-with-grayscale` og `-with-blur` kan anvendes sammen; `-constrain-*`-beskæringsmodifikatorerne kræver, at forbrugeren angiver boksens størrelse eksplicit."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Provide meaningful `alt` text that describes the image, and use an empty `alt=\"\"` for purely decorative images so assistive tech skips them."
msgstr "Giv meningsfuld `alt`-tekst, der beskriver billedet, og brug en tom `alt=\"\"` for rent dekorative billeder, så hjælpeteknologi springer dem over."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fit within the box (contain)."
msgstr "Skaler, så det passer inden for boksen (contain)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fill the box (cover)."
msgstr "Skaler for at udfylde boksen (cover)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display as a block element."
msgstr "Vis som et blok-element."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a blur effect."
msgstr "Anvend en sløringseffekt."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a grayscale effect."
msgstr "Anvend en gråtoneeffekt."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — The composed CSS filter on the image; the effect modifiers set it, and you can override it for a custom filter."
msgstr "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — Det sammensatte CSS-filter på billedet; effekt-modifikatorerne sætter det, og du kan tilsidesætte det for et brugerdefineret filter."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: in-place-edit"
msgstr ""

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-in-place-edit` — A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "`.instui-in-place-edit` — Et [contenteditable], der læses som tekst indtil det får fokus, hvorefter det viser input‑chrome."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The input chrome only appears while focused; `-readonly` suppresses both the hover and focus affordances so the element always reads as plain inline text."
msgstr "Input‑chrome vises kun mens der er fokus; `-readonly` undertrykker både hover- og fokus‑affordanser, så elementet altid læses som almindelig inline‑tekst."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the editable element `role=\"textbox\"` and an accessible name (`aria-label`)."
msgstr "Giv det redigerbare element `role=\"textbox\"` og et tilgængeligt navn (`aria-label`)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shown inline but not editable (no hover/focus affordance)."
msgstr "Vises inline, men er ikke redigerbart (ingen hover/fokus‑affordans)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — On focus it shows the same input chrome as a text input."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Ved fokus viser det samme input‑chrome som et tekstinput."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS API reference"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS API reference covers pantoken's class-based component layer: components, utilities, global rules, and declarations built on the token system."
msgstr "CSS API-referencen dækker pantokens klassebaserede komponentlag: komponenter, utilities, globale regler og deklarationer bygget på tokensystemet."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Components"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Navn"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Class"
msgstr "Klasse"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Resumé"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container for AI agents."
msgstr "En overfladecontainer til AI-agenter."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "En inline-besked med en statusfarvebjælke og et maskeret statusikon fra det delte ikon-sæt."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A user avatar showing initials or an image, circular by default."
msgstr "En brugeravatar, der viser initialer eller et billede, cirkulær som standard."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small count or status dot placed over a target's corner."
msgstr "En lille tæller- eller statusprik placeret over et objekts hjørne."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "En afviselig, ikonbesat beskedflade til side- eller kontekstmeddelelser."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large empty-state or call-to-action block: a hero icon or image, a heading, and a message."
msgstr "En stor tom-tilstand eller call-to-action-blok: et stort ikon eller billede, en overskrift og en besked."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A breadcrumb trail with separators; the last crumb is the current page."
msgstr "En brødkrummesti med separatorer; den sidste krumme er den aktuelle side."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "En krumme (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), en `<li>` i forælderens `<ol>`; den sidste er den aktuelle side."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "En tilgængelig handlingskontrol, stylet fra token-paletten; primær som standard."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "Et medieobjekt: en hovedfigur ved siden af en titel og beskrivelse."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "Et statisk månedsnet med navigation, ugedagsoverskrifter og dagsceller."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A day cell (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, and `-outside-month` mark its state."
msgstr "En dagscelle (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected` og `-outside-month` markerer dens tilstand."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "En overfladecontainer, der accepterer vilkårligt indhold."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "En native afkrydsningsboks og dens label, eller en switch via `-variant-toggle`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "En transparent ikonknap, der tegner sit eget ×-ikon, i tre størrelser plus en on-farvevariant."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "En hævet callout med caret, placerbar på enhver side; fungerer som en native `[popover]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "Et delt layout med en kollapsbar sidebakke og en primær rullebar indholdsflade."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "Den primære indholdsflade, der udfylder den resterende plads ved siden af bakken."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "Sidepanelet ved siden af hovedindholdet, med valgfrit overlay og tray-lignende overflademodifikatorer."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "En fil-dropzone med hover-, accepteret- og afvist-tilstande."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "En formular-felt-wrapper: en label, dens controls og inline-, required- eller readonly-layouts."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "En `<fieldset>`-gruppe med en legend, kolonne- eller inline-layout og konfigurerbar afstand."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "Felt-hjælp og valideringsbeskeder — hint, fejl, succes og kun-skærmlæser — med et ikon ved fejl og succes."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "Overskriftstypografi fra `-level-h1` til `-level-h6`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "En stylet `<img>` med display-, crop- og effektmodifikatorer, der stables."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "Et [contenteditable], der læses som tekst indtil fokus, hvorefter det viser input-UI."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "En facade omkring et tekstinput med slots til førende og efterfølgende ikoner."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "Et stylet hyperlink med størrelser, en invers variant til mørke baggrunde og inline- eller ustylet form."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "En liste med token-styret itemafstand."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "Et listeelement (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "En inline-overlay, der fylder sin positionerede forælder og centrerer sit indhold — f.eks. en spinner over et kort. Til en modal foretrækkes en native `<dialog>` (dens `::backdrop` er masken). Hver af disse modifikatorer findes også globalt (nøgen, eller kædet på enhver anden komponent) — se den `mask` globale utility."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "En dropdown-overflade med items, grupper og separatorer."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "En mærket gruppeoverskrift (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "Et menupunkt (InstUI `Menu.Item`); tilføj -disabled, -highlighted eller -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "En opdelingsregel mellem items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "En mærket statistik — en stor værdi over en billedtekst."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "En dialogoverflade (virker på en native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer-deltelementer."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "Indholdsregionen (InstUI `Modal.Body`); en enkelt `<img>` går fuld-bleed."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "Actions-rækken (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "Titelrækken (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "En number-input-facade med en +/- spinnerkolonne."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "Sideskiftnavigation: nummererede sider, først, foregående, næste og sidste pile samt en ellipse for mellemrum."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "Et sidelink eller -knap (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); den aktuelle side bærer `[aria-current]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "En kompakt statusetiket; tilføj et ledende ikon med den delte `-icon-<name>` form."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "En hævet overflade for en native `[popover]`, positioneret med CSS anchor-positionering."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "En determineret progressbar med en farvet meter, størrelser og en valgfri værdietiket."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
msgstr "En cirkulær progress-ring drevet af `--value` og `--value-max` custom properties."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "En native radioknap og dens label."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "Et single-select radio `<fieldset>`, enten almindelig eller som en forbundet segmenteret toggle."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "En stylet range-slider med en invers værdieboble."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "En stjernebedømmelse med fyldte og tomme glyffer og en valgfri numerisk etiket."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "En lodret navigationsskinne med ikon-over-etiket-elementer og en minimeret kun-ikoner-tilstand."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "En navigationselement (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` markerer det aktive."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "En styllet native `<select>` med caret, der matcher tekstinput-stater og -størrelser."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "En animeret indlæsningsring; giv den role=\"status\" og en aria-label."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "En styllet datatabel til `th` og `td` plus en valgfri billedtekst, med hover-, fast- og stablet-kort-layouts."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "Tabelens datarækkegruppe (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "En datacelle (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "En kolonneoverskriftscelle (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); standard `th`-styling, overskrevet af `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "Tabelens header-rækkegruppe (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "En tabelrække (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "En rækkeoverskriftscelle (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); stylet ud fra rækkeoverskrifts-tokens, ikke kolonneoverskrifts-tokens."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "Et fanebaseret panel-sæt: en faneliste, udvælgbare faner og deres paneler."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "Indholdspanelet for en fane (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "En enkelt faneknap (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, konfigureret via forælderens `Tabs`'s faneliste); `-selected` markerer den aktive."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "En inline-chip til et nøgleord eller filter."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "Brødtekst-typografi med størrelse, vægt, farve og stil-modifikatorer."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "En styllet, ændringsbar native `<textarea>` med samme stater og størrelser som tekstinput."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "En styllet native `<input>` — inklusive `date`, `time` og `datetime-local`, hvor browseren leverer pickeren — med valideringsstater og størrelser."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "En styllet native `<details>` disclosure med en roterende chevron."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "En kantet disclosure bygget på `<details>`: en opsummeringsrække med chevron og kollapsbart indhold."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "En CSS hover- og fokus-tooltip-boble, positionerbar på enhver side."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "Et kant-pinned panel, der glider ind fra enhver side; en native `[popover]` eller `<dialog>`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "Et disclosure-træ af indlejrede samlinger og blad-elementer, med roterende chevrons."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "View-primitivet: en neutral boks med nøgle–værdi-modifikatorer for baggrund, kant, radius, skygge, display, position, overflow og cursor. Hver af disse modifikatorer er også tilgængelig globalt (bar eller kædet på enhver anden komponent) — se `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Utilities"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "Semantiske farve-utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (alias som `.--color-<name>`) og `.--border-<name>` for den kuraterede semantiske palet. Hver af disse har også en komponent-tilknyttet alias-modifikator (for eksempel `-bg-danger` på enhver `.instui-<component>`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr "`cursor` som en komponerbar, global klasse — `.--cursor-<value>` — brugbar bar eller kædet på enhver komponent (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "Flex/grid `gap`-utilities på spacingskalaen, kort (`--gap-sm`) eller lang (`--gap-small`) stavemåde. Brugbar bar eller kædet på enhver komponent (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — komponenter, der allerede sætter deres egen `gap` fra et komponent-specifikt token, kan få den overskrevet."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "Ikonsystemet: `.instui-icon`-størrelser plus den delte `-icon-<name>`-painter, der masker en glyf (i `currentColor`) før ethvert element."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Display- og tekst-justerings-utilities — `.--display-<value>` og `.--text-align-<value>` — som komponerbare, globale klasser, brugbare bare eller kædet på enhver komponent."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "En global, dobbelt kopi af `mask`-komponentens overlay-modifikatorer — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — brugbar bar eller kædet på enhver komponent, uden at indpakke i et `.instui-mask`-element."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` som komponerbare, globale klasser — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — brugbare bare eller kædet på enhver komponent."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`position` as a composable, global class — `.--position-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."
msgstr "`position` som en komponerbar, global klasse — `.--position-<value>` — brugbar bar eller kædet på enhver komponent (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "Visningsport- eller container-bredde vis/skjul-klasser på tværs af et tema-baseret breakpoint-skala."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "Skjuler visuelt indhold, mens det forbliver tilgængeligt for assistiv teknologi (standard clip-mønster)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "Margin- og padding-utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` og `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` på spacing-skalaen (sider `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` eller ingen, skrevet kort eller fuldt — for eksempel er `--mb-sm` og `--margin-bottom-small` den samme regel; margin accepterer også `auto`). Kan bruges alene eller kædes på et hvilket som helst komponent (for eksempel `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "z-index-dybde-utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — kan bruges alene eller kædes på ethvert komponent, så lag stables forudsigeligt i stedet for med håndjusterede tal."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Animations-tilstandsklasser for `Transition`-komponenten — `.instui-transition` og tilstandsklasser (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, osv.) — kan bruges alene eller kædes på et hvilket som helst komponent."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "Ellipsis-trunkering med linjeklapstyret kontrol via `--lines` — kan bruges alene eller kædes på ethvert komponent (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "En layout-fejlsøgnings-outline: sammensæt `.-with-visual-debug` på ethvert element for at fremhæve boksen og dens umiddelbare børn, så layoutets struktur er synlig med et øjekast."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Rules"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opt-in global reset: `box-sizing`, the page surface, base text colour and font, `color-scheme`, and link defaults."
msgstr "Den valgfrie globale reset: `box-sizing`, sidens overflade, grundlæggende tekstfarve og font, `color-scheme` og link-standarder."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "Typografiske standarder for rå HTML — overskrifter, afsnit, lister, links og kode — anvendes automatisk hvorend det importeres (standard `:where(body)`); angiv `options.scope` for at rette mod en anden indholdsrødder (f.eks. `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure product logos as CSS image tokens: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` holds a data-URI SVG, so a logo paints via e.g. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."
msgstr "Instructure-produktlogoer som CSS-billedtokens: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` indeholder en data-URI SVG, så et logo kan males via f.eks. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw primitive palette: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` paint a colour from the primitive colour tokens, plus `font-family`/`font-weight` utilities for the primitive font tokens. Kept out of the semantic utilities so overrides there stay semantic-only."
msgstr "Valgfrie utility-klasser for det rå primitive palet: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` maler en farve fra de primitive farvetokens, plus `font-family`/`font-weight` utilities for de primitive font-tokens. Holdes ude af de semantiske utilities, så overrides der forbliver udelukkende semantiske."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "Inline informationsadvarsel til en kort påmindelse eller note."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "Fuldbredde header-sektion med titel, undertitel og valgfrit baggrundsbillede."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "Standard tre-kolonne sideopbygning med header, sidebar og hovedindhold."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "Struktureret note med rubrik-kategorier og scoringsindikatorer."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "Citat- eller testimonialvisning med attribution og valgfrit billede."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "To-kolonne layout med venstre og højre indholdsregioner."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "App-shell række: sidemenu, container med header og valgfrit panel."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-input-group` — A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "`.instui-input-group` — Et facadelag omkring et tekstinput med pladser til ikoner før og efter."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps the same field chrome as `text-input` with icon slots either side of it; `-should-not-wrap` is only needed when the group's contents would otherwise overflow onto a second line."
