msgid "The caption beneath the value."
msgstr "Underteksten under værdien."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The large metric number."
msgstr "Det store metriske tal."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.body"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.body"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — Indholdsregionen (InstUI `Modal.Body`); en enlig `&lt;img&gt;` bliver fuld-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Den overordnede `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact` og `-color-inverse` modifikatorer redesigner dette medlem — se `modal`'s egen dokumentation for disse modifikatorer."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.footer"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.footer"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — Handlingsrækken (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Den overordnede `modal`'s `-density-compact` og `-color-inverse` modifikatorer redesigner dette medlem — se `modal`'s egen dokumentation for disse modifikatorer."

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.header"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.header"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — Tittelrækken (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal"
msgstr ""

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — En dialogflade (fungerer på et native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer-dele."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Se medlemmerne `modal.header`, `modal.body` og `modal.footer` for de enkelte dele."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "Åbn den native `<dialog>` med `showModal()` for modal semantik og Esc-for-at-lukke, og navngiv den med `aria-labelledby`, der peger på `.header`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "Slør baggrunden bag modalvinduet."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "On-dark chrome (parres med et media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Ændrer farven på hver del til det mørke look."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "Tættere del-polstring. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Gør polstringen i hver del strammere."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "Begræns til viewport og rul i body. @affects modal.body — Ruller body, når modalvinduet er begrænset til viewporten."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "Tilpasset efter indhold."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "Kanter til kant."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "En bred modal. Langform alias for `-size-lg`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "En bred modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "En smal modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "En smal modal. Langform alias for `-size-sm`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "Dæmper siden bag dialogen som et maskeringslag og frostbehandler den under `-blur`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- Stiler et native &lt;dialog&gt; og dets `::backdrop`; top-lag rendering og backdrop-styling kræver en browser, der understøtter dialog-elementet."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — En tray er det samme afviselige overlay-mønster, forankret til en skærmkant."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: number-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — Et talinput-facade med en +/- spinner-kolonne."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "Knapperne i `.arrows` er `aria-hidden` og udelukkende præsentationelle — at øge/formindske værdien ved klik er forbrugerens JS at koble på."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Sæt det tilgængelige navn på `<input>` (f.eks. `aria-label`), så feltet ejer værdien; +/- spinner-knapperne er dekorative og markeret `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium."
msgstr "(standard) Medium."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "(standard) Medium. Langform-alias for `-size-md`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The +/- spinner column at the inline-end."
msgstr "Den +/- spinner-kolonne i inline-enden."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decrement button; the unclassed button increments."
msgstr "Formindsk-knappen; den uklassede knap øger."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked chevron glyph on each spinner button: up to increment, down on `.down`."
msgstr "Den maskede chevron-grafik på hver spinnerknap: op for at øge, ned for at formindske på `.down`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Deler samme input-facade-udseende.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — En anden numerisk inputkontrol."

#: css/overflow.md
