#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: page-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Standard trekolonne-sideopbygning med header, sidepanel og hovedindhold."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "✅ Brug Page-Layout når:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a classic page structure with navigation and content areas\n- The page has a clear main content area flanked by complementary regions\n- You want consistent spacing and alignment across the layout\n🚫 Don't use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "- Du har brug for en klassisk sidestruktur med navigation og indholdsområder\n- Siden har et tydeligt hovedindholdsområde flankeret af supplerende områder\n- Du ønsker konsekvent afstand og justering i hele layoutet\n🚫 Brug ikke Page-Layout når:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a single-column page — use a simpler layout instead\n- The sidebar competes with main content for importance"
msgstr "- Du bygger en en-kolonne-side — brug i stedet et simplere layout\n- Sidepanelet konkurrerer med hovedindholdet om vigtighed"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a `<main>` landmark\n- Give the sidebar `role=\"navigation\"` or `role=\"complementary\"` as appropriate\n- Ensure landmark regions have distinct aria-labels"
msgstr "- Kortlæg hovedindholdsområdet til et `<main>`-landmark\n- Giv sidepanelet `role=\"navigation\"` eller `role=\"complementary\"`, efter behov\n- Sørg for at landmark-regioner har entydige aria-labels"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main body containing sidebar and content."
msgstr "Hoveddel indeholdende sidepanel og indhold."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom footer region."
msgstr "Bundfodsområde."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top header region."
msgstr "Øverste headerområde."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Central content area."
msgstr "Centralt indholdsområde."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left navigation or auxiliary column."
msgstr "Venstre navigations- eller hjælpekolonne."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pagination` — Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "`.instui-pagination` — Side-navigation: nummererede sider, first, previous, next og last pile, og en ellipse for mellemrum."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `pagination.page` member for the individual page controls."
msgstr "Se `pagination.page`-medlemmet for de enkelte sideskontroller."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label, mark the current page with aria-current=\"page\", give each arrow an aria-label, and disable end arrows with disabled or aria-disabled=\"true\"."
msgstr "Mærk `<nav>` med aria-label, marker den aktuelle side med aria-current=\"page\", giv hver pil et aria-label, og deaktiver endepilene med disabled eller aria-disabled=\"true\"."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render arrow glyph icons inside the first/prev/next/last controls."
msgstr "Vis pile-glyf-ikoner inde i first/prev/next/last-kontrollerne."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compact variant with a page-number input."
msgstr "Kompakt variant med et sidenummerinput."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A first, previous, next, or last control."
msgstr "En first-, previous-, next- eller last-kontrol."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The gap marker between page ranges."
msgstr "Markør for mellemrum mellem sideintervaller."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The label for the page-number input (input variant)."
msgstr "Etiket for sidenummerinput (input-variant)."

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination.page"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.page` — A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "`.page` — Et side-link eller en knap (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); den aktuelle side bærer `[aria-current]`."

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current page; same styling as `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "Den aktuelle side; samme styling som `[aria-current]`."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pill"
msgstr ""

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pill` — A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "`.instui-pill` — En kompakt statusetiket; tilføj et førende glyf med den delte `-icon-<name>` form."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Unlike `badge`, which shows a count, or `tag`, which is removable, the pill is a static status label; its leading glyph is a masked `::before`, not an `<img>`."
msgstr "I modsætning til `badge`, som viser et antal, eller `tag`, som kan fjernes, er pillen en statisk statusetiket; det førende glyf er en maskeret `::before`, ikke en `<img>`."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [pill.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pill/pill.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [pill.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pill/pill.css)"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Error status."
msgstr "Fejlstatus."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Informational status."
msgstr "Informationsstatus."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positive status."
msgstr "Positiv status."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cautionary status."
msgstr "Advarselsstatus."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leading glyph from the icon set (e.g. `-icon-check`), painted before the label."
msgstr "Et førende glyf fra ikonsættet (f.eks. `-icon-check`), malet før etiketten."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — The former `renderIcon` prop; still works as an alias, but use `-icon-<name>` instead."
msgstr ""

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The leading icon glyph, sized and spaced to the pill."
msgstr "Det førende ikonglyf, størrelses- og afstandstilpasset til pillen."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — A badge is the count or notification counterpart.\n- [tag](/api/css/tag.md) — A tag is the removable, form-oriented counterpart."
msgstr "- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — Et badge er tæller- eller notifikationsmodparten.\n- [tag](/api/css/tag.md) — Et tag er den fjernelige, formularorienterede modpart."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: popover"
msgstr ""

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-popover` — An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "`.instui-popover` — En hævet overflade til en indbygget `[popover]`, placeret med CSS-ankerpositionering."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Anchor positioning is Chromium-only; the `@supports` guard means `-placement-*` is silently inert elsewhere and the UA centers the popover in the top layer instead of failing."
msgstr "Ankerpositionering er kun tilgængelig i Chromium; `@supports`-beskyttelsen betyder, at `-placement-*` er stiltiende inaktiv andre steder, og UA'en centrerer popoveren i det øverste lag i stedet for at fejle."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [popover.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/popover/popover.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [popover.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/popover/popover.css)"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Uses CSS anchor positioning (`position-anchor`/`position-area`) and the native `[popover]` API, both Chromium-only today; an `@supports` guard keeps the placement inert elsewhere, where the UA centres the popover in the top layer."
msgstr "- Bruger CSS-ankerpositionering (`position-anchor`/`position-area`) og den indbyggede `[popover]` API, som i dag begge kun virker i Chromium; en `@supports`-beskyttelse holder placeringen inaktiv andre steder, hvor UA'en centrerer popoveren i det øverste lag."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — A tooltip is a smaller, hover- or focus-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Context view is a related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — En tooltip er en mindre, hover- eller fokus-udløst forankret overflade.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Context view er en relateret forankret overflade med en pil."

