msgid "The value text centred in the ring's hole."
msgstr "Værditeksten centreret i ringens hul."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; spins `::before` at a fixed arc and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Tilpasset, ikke en del af InstUI. Gælder kun for en native `<progress>` uden `value`-attribut; drejer `::before` langs en fast bue og skjuler `.value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the ring itself: a conic-gradient donut clipped with a radial mask, whose arc tracks the `--value` custom property."
msgstr "Tegner selve ringen: en conic-gradient-donut beskåret med en radial maske, hvis bue følger den brugerdefinerede egenskab `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds to wait before starting the mount animation (default `0`)."
msgstr "Millisekunder der skal ventes, før monteringsanimationen starter (standard `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "Den maksimale fremskridtsværdi (standard `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The minimum meter value (default `0`)."
msgstr "Den minimale måleværdi (standard `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled arc (meter) colour; the -color-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Farven på den udfyldte bue (måler); -color-* modificatorerne angiver den."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring's stroke width; the -size-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Ringens stregtykkelse; -size-* modifikatorerne angiver den."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "Farven på den ufyldte bane."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "Den aktuelle fremdriftsværdi; registreret med @property, så den kan gennemgå en overgang."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} Den maksimale fremdriftsværdi (standard `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias Alias til `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "Registrerer de numeriske fremdrifts‑egenskaber med `@property` og maler med CSS `mask` og `conic-gradient`; hvor overgange for custom properties ikke understøttes, gengives ringen stadig, men den vil ikke animere."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — Den lineære bjælkeform af samme determinerede fremgang."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: progress"
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — En determineret progressbar med en farvet måler, størrelser og en valgfri værdietiket."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "`.value` er en søskende til `.bar`, begge børn af roden — hvilket spejler, hvordan progress-circle indlejrer sin egen `.value`-del. InstUI har ingen udetermineret tilstand; `:indeterminate` er et pantoken-only bedste gæt (native `<progress>` uden et `value`-attribut), animerer `.bar` som et glidende segment og skjuler `.value`, da der ikke er noget meningsfuldt tal at vise. `<meter>` har ingen udetermineret tilstand, så det påvirkes ikke."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "Renderer `.value` inde i sporet, justeret til starten i stedet for ved siden af; style den for læsbarhed oven på målerens farve."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate meter changes over half a second."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "Den udfyldte målerbjælke."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "Værditeksten ved siden af bjælken."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Brugerdefineret, ikke en del af InstUI. Gælder kun for en native `<progress>` uden `value`-attribut; animerer `.bar` som et glidende segment og skjuler `.value`."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "Tegner sporets bundlinje som et separat lag over måleren, så hele rammen og bundrammen forbliver uafhængige på tværs af temaer."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "Den aktuelle fremdriftsværdi."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "- Afgrænser målerdelens regler med `@scope` at-reglen; browsere uden `@scope`-understøttelse ignorerer disse afgrænsede regler."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
