msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — En enkelt faneknap (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, konfigureret via forælderen `Tabs`'s faneliste); `-selected` angiver den aktive."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
