msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Forælderens `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier omstiler dette medlem til en rund \"mappe\"-fane — se `tabs`'s egen dokumentation for den modifier."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
