msgstr "**Gruppe:** Plugins · **Kilde:** [visual-debug.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/visual-debug/visual-debug.css)"

#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The outline colour (default a bright magenta); retint it to change every debug outline."
msgstr "Omridsfarven (standard er en klar magenta); juster farvetonen for at ændre alle debug-omrids."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: wrapper"
msgstr ""

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell-række: side-navigation, container med header og valgfrit panel."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "✅ Brug Wrapper når:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "- Bygger en fuld Canvas-produkt-side, der har brug for en konsistent layout-shell\n- Siden bruger GlobalNav som primært navigationsanker\n- Siden har brug for sidepaneler: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea eller et UtilityPanel\n- Du har brug for ensartet container-padding og maksimal indholdsbredde på tværs af hele siden\n🚫 Brug ikke Wrapper når:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
msgstr "- Bygger en Modal, Tray eller Drawer — disse har deres egne layout-containere\n- Indhylder en underside af en side — Wrapper indeholder hele siden, ikke et område"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
msgstr "- Kortlæg hovedindholdsområdet til et &lt;main&gt;-landmark med et skip-nav-link, så tastaturnavigatører kan springe GlobalNav over\n- Giv ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" med en særskilt aria-label såsom \"Sidens navigation\" — adskilt fra GlobalNavs landmark\n- Giv TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" med en beskrivende aria-label, der afspejler dets indhold, såsom \"Studerendes oplysninger\"\n- Giv hver UtilityPanel en særskilt aria-label: \"AI-assistent\", \"Notifikationer\" eller \"Filtre\"\n- Når et UtilityPanel åbner, flyt fokus ind i panelet; når det lukkes, returner fokus til den trigger, der åbnede det"

