msgstr "Focus-ring-reglerne for en given fokuserbar selector: en transparent hvilende ring, der overgår\npå `:focus-visible`, plus `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation` modifikatorer. Alle `:where()`-omsluttet, så nul-specificitet."

