msgid "# Interface: CommandEventish"
msgstr "# Interface: CommandEventish"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "Formen på `command`/`source` for en Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (endnu ikke i DOM lib-typer)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### command"
msgstr "### command"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### source"
msgstr "### source"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### bubbles"
msgstr "### bubbles"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`bubbles`** der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen angiver, om begivenheden bobler op gennem DOM-træet eller ej."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`cancelBubble`** af Event-grænsefladen er forældet. Brug Event.stopPropagation() i stedet. Hvis du indstiller dens værdi til true før du vender tilbage fra en event-handler, forhindrer det begivenhedens udbredelse. I senere implementeringer har det ingen effekt at indstille dette til false. Se Browser-kompatibilitet for detaljer."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### Udløbet"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cancelable"
msgstr "### cancelable"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`cancelable`** der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen angiver, om begivenheden kan annulleres, og således forhindres som om den aldrig skete."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composed"
msgstr "### composed"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Den **`composed`** egenskab der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen returnerer en boolesk værdi som angiver, om begivenheden vil propagere på tværs af shadow DOM-grænsen til standard DOM."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`currentTarget`** der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen identificerer det element, som event-handleren er knyttet til."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`defaultPrevented`** der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen returnerer en boolesk værdi som angiver, om kaldet til Event.preventDefault() annullerede begivenheden."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`eventPhase`** der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen angiver, hvilken fase af begivenhedsflowet der aktuelt bliver evalueret."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Egenskaben **`isTrusted`** der kun kan læses af Event-grænsefladen er en boolesk værdi som er sand, når begivenheden blev genereret af brugeragenten (herunder via brugerhandlinger og programmatiske metoder såsom HTMLElement.focus()), og falsk, når begivenheden blev afsendt via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). Den eneste undtagelse er click-begivenheden, som initialiserer isTrusted-egenskaben til false i brugeragenter."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Event-egenskaben **`returnValue`** angiver, om standardhandlingen for denne begivenhed er blevet forhindret eller ej."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "Den forældede **`Event.srcElement`** er et alias for Event.target-egenskaben. Brug Event.target i stedet."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Den skrivebeskyttede **`target`**-egenskab for Event-grænsefladen er en reference til det objekt, hvorpå begivenheden blev sendt. Den er forskellig fra Event.currentTarget, når event-handleren kaldes under bubbling- eller capturing-fasen af begivenheden."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Den **`timeStamp`** skrivebeskyttede egenskab for Event-grænsefladen returnerer det tidspunkt (i millisekunder), hvor begivenheden blev oprettet."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Den **`type`** skrivebeskyttede egenskab for Event-grænsefladen returnerer en streng indeholdende begivenhedens type. Den angives, når begivenheden konstrueres, og er det navn, der almindeligvis bruges til at referere til den specifikke begivenhed, såsom click, load eller error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### NONE"
msgstr "### NONE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### AT\\_TARGET"
msgstr "### AT\\_TARGET"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composedPath()"
msgstr "### composedPath()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Metoden **`composedPath()`** for Event-grænsefladen returnerer begivenhedens sti, som er en matrix af de objekter, som lyttere vil blive påkaldt på. Dette inkluderer ikke noder i skyggetræer, hvis skyggeroden blev oprettet med dens ShadowRoot.mode lukket."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~initEvent()~~"
msgstr "### ~~initEvent()~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "Metoden **`Event.initEvent()`** bruges til at initialisere værdien af en begivenhed oprettet ved hjælp af Document.createEvent()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### type"
msgstr "##### type"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### bubbles?"
msgstr "##### bubbles?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### cancelable?"
msgstr "##### cancelable?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### preventDefault()"
msgstr "### preventDefault()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`preventDefault()`** method of the Event interface tells the user agent that the event is being explicitly handled, so its default action, such as page scrolling, link navigation, or pasting text, should not be taken."
msgstr "Metoden **`preventDefault()`** for Event-grænsefladen fortæller brugeragenten, at begivenheden bliver håndteret eksplicit, så dens standardhandling, såsom sidescrolling, linknavigation eller indsætning af tekst, ikke skal foretages."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopImmediatePropagation()"
msgstr "### stopImmediatePropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents other listeners of the same event from being called."
msgstr "Metoden **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** for Event-grænsefladen forhindrer andre lyttere af den samme begivenhed i at blive kaldt."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopPropagation()"
msgstr "### stopPropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopPropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents further propagation of the current event in the capturing and bubbling phases. It does not, however, prevent any default behaviors from occurring; for instance, clicks on links are still processed. If you want to stop those behaviors, see the preventDefault() method. It also does not prevent propagation to other event-handlers of the current element. If you want to stop those, see stopImmediatePropagation()."
msgstr "Metoden **`stopPropagation()`** for Event-grænsefladen forhindrer yderligere udbredelse af den aktuelle begivenhed i capturing- og bubbling-faserne. Den forhindrer dog ikke eventuelle standardadfærd i at forekomme; for eksempel behandles klik på links stadig. Hvis du vil stoppe denne adfærd, se metoden preventDefault(). Den forhindrer heller ikke udbredelse til andre event-handlere for det aktuelle element. Hvis du vil stoppe det, se stopImmediatePropagation()."

