#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# utils"
msgstr "# utils"

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken packages: the token\nreference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes (typed via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing scale, reference-drift\nvalidation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both `@pantoken/components`\n(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build on. Depends only on\n`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without pulling the GitHub-only\nupstream."
msgstr "`@pantoken/utils` — delte, upstream-frie hjælpere brugt på tværs af pantoken-pakkerne: token-\nreference resolver (med `light-dark()` håndtering), de to token regexer (skrevet via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-farve-parsing, SVG-sanering, pantoken-spacing-skalaen, reference-drift\nvalidering, og de generiske token→utility-class emittenter som både `@pantoken/components`\n(semantisk tier) og `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) bygger på. Afhænger kun af\n`@pantoken/model` (typer) + `arkregex`, så enhver pakke kan bruge det uden at trække GitHub-only\nupstream."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nentry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON load that breaks when\npulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-facing packages (e.g.\n`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr "css-tree-understøttet token-syntaksvalidator bor ved det separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nindgang, ikke denne barrel — `css-tree` samler en runtime `createRequire()` JSON-indlæsning som bryder når\ndet trækkes ind i en browser/SSR-bundle, og denne barrel importeres af browser-orienterede pakker (f.eks.\n`@pantoken/components`) for de Node-frie hjælpere ovenfor."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add new helpers there and\nre-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr "En ren barrel — hver implementering bor i sit eget diskret modul; tilføj nye hjælpere der og\ngen-eksportér dem her, udvid ikke denne fil."

