#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# android"
msgstr "# android"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — udsend Instructure design-tokens som Android-ressource XML."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Det udfladder IR'en til konkrete, enkelt-tilstands værdier (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), derefter\nudsender `res/values/colors.xml` (farve-tokens) og `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimensions-tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary anvender Android-transformerne (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "Omdøber og re-eksporterer [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

