msgstr "Script(e). Standard [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
