msgstr "Oversat kommentar-strenge. Standard [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnFile"
msgstr "# Interface: CdnFile"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "En enkelt fil til indlæsning fra en CDN, identificeret ved npm-pakkenavn og sti inden i den."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### package"
msgstr "### package"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "npm-pakkenavnet, f.eks. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "Stien inden i pakken, f.eks. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Udelad for at referere til pakkeroden."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Tilsidesætter provider/build-level-versionen for denne fil kun."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### raw?"
msgstr "### raw?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "For providere, der transformerer JS som standard (esm.sh): `false` lader provideren anvende dens normale ESM-transformation (nødvendig for at `import` et reelt pakkeindgangspunkt). Standard til `true` — serverer filen uændret, påkrævet for forbyggede/ikke-ESM-aktiver som CSS-ark og IIFE-bundler."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnProvider"
msgstr "# Interface: CdnProvider"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "Et CDN, der kan servere npm-pakkefiler. Providere hardcoder aldrig et pakkenavn — de ved kun, hvordan man danner en URL fra en [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### id"
msgstr "### id"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "Stabil identifikator, f.eks. `\"jsdelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### label"
msgstr "### label"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
