#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — omdøb lange custom property navne til minimale sekventielle\nidentifikatorer."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Token-navne som `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` er menneskeligt læsbare men dyre i\nminimerede bundles: selve navnet er 40+ bytes, gentaget i definitionen, hver `var()` kald,\nog hver `@property` registrering. Dette plugin erstatter ethvert matchende navn — gennem definitioner,\n`var()` referencer, og `@property` params — med en minimal identifikator (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), reducerer navneomkostninger med ~90%."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Navne indsamles fra det fulde stylesheet, sorteret alfabetisk for en deterministisk kortlægning, derefter tildelt sekventielt. En [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) mulighed lader flere separate PostCSS-passes dele en konsistent kortlægning, så separat behandlede CSS-filer, der indlæses sammen, kan sikkert manglificeres med de samme navne."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Muligheder for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Kun egenskabsnavne for brugerdefinerede, der starter med denne streng, manglificeres."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "Algoritmen brugt til at generere korte erstatningsnavne."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (standard; korteste for store sæt)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alfanumerisk)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Når `true`, tilføjer en `mangle-map` post til PostCSS `result.messages` efter behandling.\nBeskeden har form `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "En ændrelig `Map` delt på tværs af flere PostCSS-passes."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "På hver pass læser plugin'et eksisterende poster (genbrug deres korte navne) og skriver nye (fortsætter tæller fra `sharedManifest.size`). Overfør den samme `Map` instans til hvert `mangleCustomProps` eller `applyMinify` kald, der behandler CSS-filer, som indlæses sammen i browseren — dette garanterer, at alle filer bruger en identisk navnekortlægning."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Behandl token-arket først, så dets navne såes i manifestet, før komponentarke tilføjer deres (typisk overlappende) referencer."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Typealias: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Strategi for generering af kort navn for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Variabel: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Opret plugin'et mangle-custom-properties PostCSS."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Indsamler alle egenskabsnavne for brugerdefinerede, der matcher `prefix` fra erklæringsprops, `var()` referencer og `@property` parametre. Sorterer dem alfabetisk for en stabil, deterministisk kortlægning, derefter tildeler korte navne ved hjælp af den valgte `method`. Erstatter hvert forekomst i hele stylesheet'et."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Manglificer med standardindstillinger (--instui-\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Del kortlægningen på tværs af to filer indlæst sammen**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Brug base36-navne og emit kortlægningen via result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Funktion: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Anvend minificering af brugerdefineret egenskab til en stylesheet-streng."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Bygger et PostCSS plugin-array fra `options` og kører det synkront. Plugin-rækkefølge:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returnerer input uændret når ingen indstillinger er indstillet."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "Stylesheet-strengen til at transformere."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "Den transformerede CSS-streng."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — komponér prune-, flatten- og mangle-transformationer for `--instui-*` brugerdefinerede egenskaber via et enkelt [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) værktøj."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Hver CSS-emitterende pipeline (generer scripts, renderere) bruger `applyMinify` til en konsistent minificeringsflade uden at tage en direkte PostCSS-afhængighed."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle er kun sikker for selvindeholdt bundles**, hvor alle `var(--instui-*)` referencer og deres definitioner bor i det samme output. For separate-fil-forbrugere (`@pantoken/css` + `@pantoken/components` indlæst uafhængigt), anvend kun `{ flatten: true }`."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Manglificer på tværs af filgrænser:** overfør den samme `Map` instans som `mangle.sharedManifest` til hvert `applyMinify` kald, der behandler CSS-filer indlæst sammen. Behandl token-arket først (det såer manifestet), derefter komponentarke."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Anvend alle tre transformationer på et selvindeholdt bundle**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Kun udlign (sikker for separate-fil-forbrugere)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Manglificer to filer med samme kortlægning**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Muligheder for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Anvend [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) til tree-shake ubrugte `--instui-*` tokens før andre transformationer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "Kun sikker for selvindeholdt bundles, der indeholder både token-definitioner og komponentregler, der refererer til dem. Beskæring af et token-kun ark fjerner alt."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Anvend [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) til at konvertere `@property` at-regler til plain deklarationer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` bruger plugin-standardindstillinger (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nMed [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md)-objektet kan du tilsidesætte individuelle standardindstillinger."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Anvend [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) til at erstatte lange `--instui-*`-navne med minimale identifikatorer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` bruger plugin-standardindstillinger (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nMed [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md)-objektet kan du tilsidesætte individuelle standardindstillinger — herunder\n`sharedManifest` til koordinering på tværs af filer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Kun sikker for selvstændige bundler. Se modulniveaudokumentation."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pruneCustomProps"
msgstr "# Variabel: pruneCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Opret prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS-plugin'en."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"
msgstr "**Kør det som en selvstændig PostCSS-pass**"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# prune-custom-props"
msgstr "# prune-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties from a composed\nstylesheet."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake ubrugte brugerdefinerede egenskaber fra et komponeret stylesheet."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 icon data-URIs\nincluded). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of the system would\notherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting from the `var()`\nreferences in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps only the custom\nproperties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` registrations."
msgstr "pantokens `@pantoken/css` udsender hele `--instui-*`-tokensættet (≈1.800 ikon-data-URIer inkluderet). En renderer, der bygger på det lag, men kun stiliserer en del af systemet, ville ellers sende hele sættet — så enhver sådan renderer ønsker dette. Startende fra `var()` referencer i rigtige (ikke-brugerdefinerede-egenskab) deklarationer, holder den kun de brugerdefinerede egenskaber, der faktisk kan nås, og fjerner de matchende ubrugte `@property`-registreringer."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The factory returns a\nplain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency — `postcss` is only\na type."
msgstr "Det er et selvstændigt PostCSS-plugin (kør det i din egen PostCSS-pipeline). Fabrikken returnerer et standard plugin-objekt, så import af dette modul trækker ingen runtime-afhængighed ind — `postcss` er kun en type."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"
msgstr "Omdøber og gen-eksporterer [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# theme-custom-media"
msgstr "# theme-custom-media"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: <name>)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — forfat med tema brugerdefinerede-identifikatorer (`@media (theme: &lt;name&gt;)`) og/eller `@media (--theme-*)`-alias, og udsted derefter konkret CSS for et valgt mål-tema."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes non-target theme\nbranches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps always-true theme-only media\nwrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` declarations from emitted CSS."
msgstr "Plugin'en udvider indbyggede `--theme-*`- og `--breakpoint-*`-alias, fjerner ikke-mål-tema-grene, fjerner matchende `theme:*`-klausuler fra bevaret forespørgsler, udpakker altid-sande tema-eneste medie-wrappere, og fjerner `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*`-deklarationer fra udsendt CSS."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"
msgstr "Omdøber og gen-eksporterer [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ThemeCustomMediaOptions"
msgstr "# Interface: ThemeCustomMediaOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the theme custom-media plugin."
msgstr "Indstillinger for tema custom-media plugin'en."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target theme to emit (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Mål-tema til at udsende (standard `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/type-aliases/Theme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A theme the plugin can target when emitting concrete CSS."
msgstr "Et tema plugin'en kan målrette, når der udsendes konkret CSS."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: themeCustomMedia"
msgstr "# Variabel: themeCustomMedia"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the theme custom-media lowering plugin."
msgstr "Opret tema custom-media sænknings-plugin'en."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Supports authoring with either direct theme custom-idents in media features (for example,\n`(theme: canvas)`) or built-in `@custom-media --theme-*` aliases."
msgstr "Understøtter forfattelse med enten direkte tema brugerdefinerede-identifikatorer i media features (for eksempel `(theme: canvas)`) eller indbyggede `@custom-media --theme-*`-alias."

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: load()"
msgstr "# Funktion: load()"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "TypeDoc entry point. Registers a resolve-time pass that rewrites `@demo` tags into demo fences."
msgstr "TypeDoc indgangspunkt. Registrerer en resolve-time-pass, der omskriver `@demo`-tags til demo-hegn."

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### app"
msgstr "### app"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
#, no-c-format
