msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# pendo"
msgstr "# pendo"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — et globalt stylesheet designet af Instructure til Pendo-vejledninger."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Pendo indsætter guide-HTML i en værtside; dette renderer den guide-DOM (`._pendo-*`) for at matche Instructure UI ved at bruge pantokens `--instui-*` token-lag til justering. Den inkluderer responsive violet- og sea-banner-guidebehandlinger sammen med advarsler, popovers, undersøgelser og kontrolelementer. Komponentens CSS er portet fra `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken leverer tokens og samling. En enkelt tema-klasse, der indeholder `instui`, aktiverer det scoped stylesheet; kompakte suffikser på den klasse vælger bannerfarver og ikoner."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) komponerer stylesheetet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) er den færdige `rebrand` opbygning\n(omfang, `!important`). En statisk fil publiceres på `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

