msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Theme to source the `--instui-*` layer from (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Tema at hente `--instui-*` laget fra (standard `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### scopeSelector?"
msgstr "### scopeSelector?"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `@scope` root selector (default `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`)."
msgstr "Den `@scope` rod-selektor (standard `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap component rules in `@scope` for DOM containment (default `true`)."
msgstr "Omslut komponentregler i `@scope` til DOM-indeslutning (standard `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### important?"
msgstr "### important?"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Tilføj `!important` til komponentdeklarationer, så de slår Pendos stilarter (standard `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Tree-shake ubrugte `--instui-*` tokens (standard `true`; slukket leverer det fulde token-sæt)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Konverter `@property` at-regler til almindelige custom-property-deklarationer via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (standard `false`). `true` bruger plugin-standarder med\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` så deklarationerne lander inde i `@scope` blokken.\nGiv et [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) objekt for at tilsidesætte individuelle standarder."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Blanding af `--instui-*` navne til minimale base-26-identifikatorer via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(standard `false`). Sikker her, fordi det fulde token + komponentstylesheet er en\nselvstyret bundle. Giv et [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) objekt for at tilsidesætte standarder."

