msgstr "# Funktion: rehypeColorCodes()"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeColorCodes.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that wraps standalone color values in `<span data-color-code=\"…\">`, so the React\nlayer can render a swatch. Mirrors the icon-token pipeline."
msgstr "Et rehype-plugin, der omslutter selvstændige farveværdier i `<span data-color-code=\"…\">`, så React-laget\nkan gengive en farveprøve. Spejler ikon-token-pipelinen."

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeGithubAlerts.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: rehypeGithubAlerts()"
msgstr "# Funktion: rehypeGithubAlerts()"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeGithubAlerts.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that tags GitHub-alert blockquotes: it detects a `[!NOTE]`-style marker at the\nstart of a blockquote, records it as `data-alert=\"note\"`, and strips the marker text. The React\n`blockquote` component then renders an InstUI `Alert`."
msgstr "Et rehype-plugin, der mærker GitHub-varsel-citattegn: det registrerer en `[!NOTE]`-stilmarkør ved\ncitattegnets start, registrerer det som `data-alert=\"note\"`, og fjerner markørteksten. React\n`blockquote` komponenten gengiver derefter en InstUI `Alert`."

