#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accessibility guidance, from `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."
msgstr "Tilgængelighedsvejledning, fra `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### global?"
msgstr "### global?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set when this record carries a `@global` tag — its modifiers (and per-modifier `@global` flags)\napply to any component/layout/rule/declaration, not just this record's base class. Used during\nvalidation and consumption checks to resolve modifier matches globally."
msgstr "Indstillet når denne post bærer et `@global` tag — dets modifikatorer (og per-modifier `@global` flag)\nkan anvendes på enhver komponent/layout/regel/erklæring, ikke kun denne posts basisklasse. Brugt under\nvaliderings- og forbrugskontroller til at løse modifier-matches globalt."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
