#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Native pseudo-elements the component styles (`::before`, `::marker`, …), from `@pseudo` or a selector."
msgstr "Native pseudo-elementer som komponenten styler (`::before`, `::marker`, …), fra `@pseudo` eller en vælger."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
