#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-img>` — a token-styled `<img>` built from `src`/`alt`. `constrain` maps to\n`-constrain-<value>` (e.g. `cover`, `contain`) and `display=\"block\"` to `-display-block`."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-img&gt;` — en token-stiliseret `&lt;img&gt;` bygget fra `src`/`alt`. `constrain` kortlægges til\n`-constrain-&lt;value&gt;` (f.eks. `cover`, `contain`) og `display=\"block\"` til `-display-block`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/inPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: inPlaceEdit"
msgstr "# Variabel: inPlaceEdit"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/inPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-in-place-edit>` — a click-to-edit field. `value` shows as text; on click/focus it becomes\neditable, Enter or blur commits (and fires a bubbling `change` event with `detail.value`), and\nEscape reverts to the pre-edit value. `readonly` disables editing. An external `value` change\nreflects into the field while it isn't being edited."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-in-place-edit&gt;` — et klik-for-at-redigere-felt. `value` vises som tekst; ved klik/fokus bliver det\nredigerbart, Enter eller blur bekræfter (og udløser en bobbende `change` begivenhed med `detail.value`), og\nEscape vender tilbage til værdi før redigering. `readonly` deaktiverer redigering. En ekstern `value` ændring\nreflekteres ind i feltet mens det ikke bliver redigeret."

