msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pages"
msgstr "# Variabel: pages"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-pages>` — shows one slotted `[data-page]` panel at a time, swapping with the View\nTransitions API when available (a plain toggle otherwise). `push(id)`/`back()` keep a history\nstack; the `active` attribute reflects the current page and can be set to navigate, and a bubbling\n`change` event (`detail.page`) fires per swap. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--push\" commandfor=\"pages-id\" data-page=\"…\">` and\n`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"pages-id\">`."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-pages&gt;` — viser ét slottet `[data-page]` panel ad gangen, og skifter med View Transitions API, når det er tilgængeligt (en simpel toggle ellers). `push(id)`/`back()` gemmer en historikstack; attributten `active` afspejler den nuværende side og kan sættes for at navigere, og en boublende `change` begivenhed (`detail.page`) udløses ved hvert skift. Kan styres fra light DOM via Invoker Commands: `<button command=\"--push\" commandfor=\"pages-id\" data-page=\"…\">` og `<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"pages-id\">`."

