#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-popover>` — a floating surface. Like `<instui-context-view>`, the host is a native\n`[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget` button can toggle it by id.\nContent goes in the default slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-popover&gt;` — en flydende flade. Som `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;` er værten et oprindeligt `[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss), så en light-DOM `popovertarget` knap kan skifte den efter id. Indhold går i standardslotten."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: progress"
msgstr "# Variabel: progress"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress>` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-progress&gt;` — en vandret indikator understøttet af oprindelig `&lt;progress&gt;` eller `&lt;meter&gt;` semantik."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. `variant` maps the\ncomponent to `-color-<variant>` and `label` supplies its accessible name."
msgstr "`value-now`/`value` styrer `--value`, mens `min` og `value-max`/`max` styrer området. Et nul-minimum gengiver et oprindeligt `&lt;progress&gt;`; et ikke-nul-minimum gengiver `&lt;meter&gt;`. Tilføj det booleske `should-animate` attribut for at overgange målermændringer over et halvt sekund. `variant` kortlægger komponenten til `-color-&lt;variant&gt;` og `label` giver dens tilgængelighednavn."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: progressCircle"
msgstr "# Variabel: progressCircle"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress-circle>` — a circular indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-progress-circle&gt;` — en cirkulær indikator understøttet af oprindelig `&lt;progress&gt;` eller `&lt;meter&gt;` semantik."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to animate from zero on mount; `animation-delay` is a millisecond delay.\n`label` overrides the accessible name (which otherwise defaults to the percentage)."
msgstr "`value-now`/`value` styrer `--value`, mens `min` og `value-max`/`max` styrer området. Et nul-minimum gengiver et oprindeligt `&lt;progress&gt;`; et ikke-nul-minimum gengiver `&lt;meter&gt;`. Tilføj det booleske `should-animate` attribut for at animere fra nul ved montering; `animation-delay` er en millisekund-forsinkelse. `label` tilsidesætter tilgængelighadsnavnet (som ellers som standard er procentdelen)."

