#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tray>` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-<value>`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tray&gt;` — et panel forbundet til en visningsportedge, understøttet af et oprindeligt `[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss). `placement` kortlægges til `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (f.eks. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) og `size` til `-size-&lt;value&gt;`; en light-DOM `popovertarget` knap skifter den efter id. Indhold går i standardslotten."

