msgid "# Function: resolveDemo()"
msgstr "# Funktion: resolveDemo()"

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/demo` — the render side of the `@demo` system."
msgstr "`@pantoken/demo` — gengivelses-siden af `@demo` systemet."

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` turns a `@demo <spec>` tag into a fenced `demo` block whose\nbody is the spec (a bare URL or a `<provider>:<ref>` pair). This package resolves that spec into an\nembeddable iframe and renders the surrounding panel — an MDN-style \"live sample.\""
msgstr "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` omdanner en `@demo &lt;spec&gt;` tag til en omgivet `demo` blok hvis\nindhold er spec'en (en bar URL eller et `&lt;provider&gt;:&lt;ref&gt;` par). Denne pakke løser spec'en til en\nindlejringsbar iframe og gengiver det omgivende panel — et MDN-stil \"live sample\"."

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships three things: [resolveDemo](functions/resolveDemo.md) (spec → iframe attributes, framework-agnostic), a\nmarkdown-it plugin ([demoMarkdownIt](functions/demoMarkdownIt.md)) that turns `demo` fences into the panel HTML, and a\nself-hosted runner (`@pantoken/demo/runner.html`) — a same-origin page that fetches a bare\nHTML/CSS/JS demo and renders it with your token stylesheets injected, so `self:` demos need no\nthird-party account and no framing workarounds."
msgstr "Det leverer tre ting: [resolveDemo](functions/resolveDemo.md) (spec → iframe attributter, framework-agnostisk), et\nmarkdown-it plugin ([demoMarkdownIt](functions/demoMarkdownIt.md)) som omdanner `demo` fold til panel HTML, og en\nself-hosted runner (`@pantoken/demo/runner.html`) — en same-origin side som henter et bart\nHTML/CSS/JS demo og gengiver det med dine token stylesheets injiceret, så `self:` demos ikke behøver\ntredjepartsaccount og ingen ramme workarounds."

